---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于我">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <div class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-github-card border-2 border-github-border mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-4xl">
      👤
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-github-heading mt-4">{SITE.author}</h1>
    <p class="text-github-text/50 mt-1">前端工程师 / 终身学习者</p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-p:text-github-text/90 prose-a:text-github-accent">
    <p>{SITE.description}</p>
    <p>
      这里记录我学习和思考的过程。写博客是为了整理知识、分享经验，也希望能帮助到有需要的人。
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 p-6 rounded-lg border border-github-border bg-github-card/50">
    <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-github-heading mb-4">技能</h2>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1">
          <span class="text-github-text">JavaScript / TypeScript</span>
          <span class="text-github-text/50">80%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-1.5 rounded-full bg-github-border">
          <div class="h-full rounded-full bg-github-accent" style="width:80%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1">
          <span class="text-github-text">React / Vue</span>
          <span class="text-github-text/50">70%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-1.5 rounded-full bg-github-border">
          <div class="h-full rounded-full bg-github-accent" style="width:70%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="flex justify-between text-sm mb-1">
          <span class="text-github-text">Node.js</span>
          <span class="text-github-text/50">60%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="h-1.5 rounded-full bg-github-border">
          <div class="h-full rounded-full bg-github-accent" style="width:60%"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-10 flex justify-center gap-8">
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="text-github-text/60 hover:text-github-accent transition-colors text-sm">
      📧 邮箱
    </a>
    <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-github-text/60 hover:text-github-accent transition-colors text-sm">
      🐙 GitHub
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
